ColdFusion CFML (tag + cfscript) tree-sitter grammar
  Path:      crates/wicked-estate-extract/vendor/tree-sitter-cfml/
  Crate:     wicked-estate-tree-sitter-cfml
  Origin:    Vendored from https://github.com/cfmleditor/tree-sitter-cfml;
             its grammar sources (grammar.js, src/grammar.json, the scanners,
             common/) and LICENSE are byte-identical to upstream commit
             6b4a43943c191950ee2c77f7b94cec5e903318a4 (tag v0.26.20), except
             three local patches, each marked WICKED PATCH: 1 in
             cfscript/src/scanner.c (the query-text scan also stops at the
             end of the input); 2 and 3 in common/scanner.h (deserialize
             reads within its buffer; four start tags free their names).
             parser.c, node-types.json and the tree_sitter/ headers are
             generated from grammar.json by the pinned tree-sitter CLI.
             Cargo.toml, README.md, tree-sitter.json and bindings/rust/ are
             this repository's.
  License:   MIT License (the terms of this product's LICENSE file)
             Copyright (c) 2014 Gareth Edwards & Gavin Baumanis
             The full license text ships in the directory (LICENSE).
